- `databricks/koalas/series.py::Series`: The class where the user interacts with the data.
- `databricks/koalas/base.py::IndexOpsMixin`: The class containing the arithmetic operator implementations (`__add__`, `__sub__`, etc.).
- `databricks/koalas/base.py::align_diff_series`: A utility function imported in `base.py` that is likely intended to help with alignment.

