The issue also mentioned escape character recognition and configuration URL resolution differences between main and worker. These issues appear to be related to the core interpreter or the way communication is handled between the main thread and the worker, rather than the terminal plugin itself. Given the scope of this change request and the current codebase, I have focused on the Py Terminal error display issue.

