I have updated the `YAMLParser` class in `insights/core/__init__.py` to use `yaml.CSafeLoader` if it is available in the `yaml` module, which significantly improves parsing performance when `libyaml` is installed. If `CSafeLoader` is not available, it falls back to the standard `yaml.SafeLoader`.

Summary of changes:
