### Cause of the problem
When launching EC2 instances, AWS may encounter a situation where there is insufficient capacity for the requested instance type in a specific Availability Zone, resulting in an `InsufficientInstanceCapacity` error. The default retry behavior of `botocore` (4 retries) was insufficient to handle these transient capacity issues, causing the module to fail quickly.

